OL,3,GNEWSABarber offers free back-to-school
OL,4,Ahaircuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA barber is offering free
OL,7,Fback-to-school haircuts, stationery and
OL,8,Fschool essentials to help families
OL,9,Ffacing rising costs.
OL,11,FSid Gumbrell, who runs Clean Cuts
OL,12,FBarber Shop, in Guildford in Surrey, is
OL,13,Fhosting the event from 09:00 BST to
OL,14,F17:00 on Sunday.
OL,16,FChildren will also be able to pick up
OL,17,Ffree stationery, pencil cases and water
OL,18,Fbottles.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
