OL,3,GNEWSABarber offers free back-to-school
OL,4,Ahaircuts
OL,5,
OL,6,F"To be honest, I know the struggles
OL,7,Fwith the cost of things at the moment,"
OL,8,FMr Gumbrell said. "School uniforms,
OL,9,Fshoes, haircuts, etc, it all adds up
OL,10,Fand if we can just help take one cost
OL,11,Faway it's a massive deal for us."
